## Original Content
DES DIVAS ET DES BIJOUX (1/6) - Ses bijoux, la star country préférait les coudre sur ses tenues insensées, pleines de paillettes et de perlouses. Un univers de strass pour mieux mettre en lumière son aura féministe et philanthropique adulée par l'Amérique.

## Summary
Dolly Parton, the country music star, preferred to sew her jewelry onto her outrageous, sequin-covered outfits to emphasize her feminist and philanthropic persona. This style is admired by America and is part of a series on divas and jewelry.

## Key Points
- Dolly Parton customized her outfits by sewing on jewelry and embellishments.
- Her fashion featured extravagant elements like sequins and beads to create a rhinestone-studded look.
- The style highlighted her feminist and philanthropic image, which is widely celebrated in America.


